{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24637","headline":"酬南洛阳早春见赠 · 白居易","name":"酬南洛阳早春见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"物华春意尚迟回，赖有东风昼夜催。\n寒缒柳腰收未得，暖熏花口噤初开。\n欲披云雾联襟去，先喜琼琚入袖来。\n久病长斋诗老退，争禁年少洛阳才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}